For a sorted rectangular cusp

\[
 f_+=cH^\alpha,\qquad g_+=dH^\beta,qquad
 1<\alpha<\beta,quad \gcd(\alpha,\beta)=1,
 \tag{1.9}
\]

the first relation has \((k_0,l_0)=(\alpha,\beta)\) and

\[
 h_1=g^\alpha-\frac{d^\alpha}{c^\beta}f^\beta.

