### 4.3 The cusp remainder detects the pole breakpoint

Along the common \(y\)-side trunk, let \(0\le u<1/2\) and put
\(\eta=x^u y\). Then

\[
 f=x^{4-6u}\eta^6-x,qquad
 g=x^{6-9u}\eta^9-2x^{2-u}\eta.
